{"4227590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Career's End", "steam_appid": 4227590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>immersive</strong> physics-based sandbox, you play as a serious CEO man who is about to take the stage to discuss high-tech business in front of an enthusiastic crowd. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE fantasy everyone wants to experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins normally: as you enter the stage, you can clap, dance, and take a bow. You can cycle through the fake presentation slides behind you and even control the camera angles and zoom - just like a live TV broadcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227590/extras/6d6a053518acf9d4aee4a7c72bc8b085.poster.avif?t=1771969166\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227590/extras/6d6a053518acf9d4aee4a7c72bc8b085.webm?t=1771969166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4227590/extras/6d6a053518acf9d4aee4a7c72bc8b085.mp4?t=1771969166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNMATCHED physics interaction</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can jump around and knock over equipment and people - <strong>embarrassing</strong> yourself in the process, which is by far the more fun option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store